# Everything this repository ignores, in one file (dbmeta D58).

# The Claude Code permissions of one person. The shared .claude/settings.json
# is not ignored, because a setting that belongs to the project is committed.
# See dbmeta D89.
.claude/settings.local.json

# The git worktrees in which the coding agents work. Each one is a checkout of
# this repository, and its work comes back through the main checkout.
/.claude/worktrees/

# The packages that the generator of the targets installs with npm. The
# versions are pinned in docs/targets/package.json and its lock file.
/docs/targets/node_modules/

# The output of the generator of the targets and its lock file. The
# maintainers chose on 2026-11-10 not to commit them for now. Run the
# generator to see the targets, as docs/targets/README.md says.
/docs/targets/svg/
/docs/targets/index.html
/docs/targets/package-lock.json

# The WebAssembly file that the TinyGo job of CI builds.
/test/zuzu.wasm

# The references that the oracle writes, about 174 MB, and the packages it
# installs with npm. Run the oracle to make them, as test/README.md says.
/test/testdata/references/
/test/oracle/node_modules/
/test/oracle/package-lock.json
